{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-critters-55","title":{"zh":"遭遇[encountered_marauder.GetRealName]","en":"[encountered_marauder.GetRealName] Encountered"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/3745f25faed16562b16c.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.55","chapters":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们完成了对他们使用语言的破译，[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]将[encountered_marauder.GetName]识别为一种游牧文明，称为[encountered_marauder.GetRealName]。他们在[marauder_system.GetName]恒星系附近占据了数个大型空间站，其大量的人口都居住在拥挤而肮脏的环境之中。尽管如此，或许正因如此，他们似乎发展出了一种非常尚武的文化。生活在冰冷虚空中成了他们的第二天性，因而高度擅长太空作战。","en":"Having decoded what counts as a language among them, [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName] has identified the [encountered_marauder.GetName] as a nomadic civilization known as the [encountered_marauder.GetRealName]. They occupy a number of large space st"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact_critters.55","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.55","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"遭遇[encountered_marauder.GetRealName]","en":"[encountered_marauder.GetRealName] Encountered"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们完成了对他们使用语言的破译，[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]将[encountered_marauder.GetName]识别为一种游牧文明，称为[encountered_marauder.GetRealName]。他们在[marauder_system.GetName]恒星系附近占据了数个大型空间站，其大量的人口都居住在拥挤而肮脏的环境之中。尽管如此，或许正因如此，他们似乎发展出了一种非常尚武的文化。生活在冰冷虚空中成了他们的第二天性，因而高度擅长太空作战。\n\n[encountered_marauder.GetSpeciesName]没有中央政府一说，而是分为数个不同的派系，不断地互相争夺资源与尊严。鉴于其庞大的人口与空间站造船能力，若无永无止境的内斗，他们必将成为严重威胁到全星系和平的势力。","en":"Having decoded what counts as a language among them, [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName] has identified the [encountered_marauder.GetName] as a nomadic civilization known as the [encountered_marauder.GetRealName]. They occupy a number of large space stations in and around the [marauder_system.GetName] system that house the bulk of their massive numbers in crowded and squalid conditions. Despite this, or perhaps because of it, they seem to have developed a strong martial culture. Life in the cold void has become second nature to them, and they are very adept at space warfare.\n\nThere is no [encountered_marauder.GetSpeciesName] central government to speak of. Instead, they are divided into several different factions that vie endlessly with one another for resources and respect. Given their large population and the shipbuilding capability of their stations, this constant infighting is the only thing keeping them from growing into a significant threat to galactic peace."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/3745f25faed16562b16c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"marauder.1.a","label":{"zh":"尝试与他们联络。","en":"Attempt to contact them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13974","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13974","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"any_country","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet1_country","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_same_value","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet1_country","scope":"","v